OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fbecoming confined to Argyll by late
OL,7,Fevening, as clear spells develop.
OL,8,FCloud increasing overnight in Argyll,
OL,9,Fbringing patchy rain here by dawn.
OL,10,FSoutherly winds strengthening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FWindy. Most staying dry
OL,13,Fthrough to mid-afternoon with some
OL,14,Flimited early brightness. Patchy rain
OL,15,Fin Argyll developing and extending to
OL,16,Fthe rest of the area late afternoon to
OL,17,Fearly evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
